// proof — the formally verified decision core of Kunloria.
//
// This package is intentionally tiny and free of I/O: it encodes the
// load-bearing security decision (role x action-kind x group-prefix) over
// integer codes so that `moon prove` can discharge its contracts with SMT
// solvers. Every other package consumes this core; nothing here depends on
// JSON, HTTP, or strings.

options(
  "proof-enabled": true,
)
